  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic activities for international RBC agreement for Insurance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Basic activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for Insurance&apos;, Oxfam Novib, Stichting Natuur en Milieu, Stichting Save The Children Nederland, Stichting Vredesbeweging Pax Nederland and Stichting WRLD Animal Protect, the Dutch department contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of RBC sector agreement for Insurance.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
